        "evidence_ids": ["f9", "a3"],
        "claimed_result": "f9 (PAY_6 = 2.0) is the primary adverse factor",
        "alleged_conflict": "The model attribution is to the derived feature group \"pay_max (derived)\" (contribution = +0.5058), not directly to the observed fact f9. The fact f9 has no individual attribution, so the claim assigns driver status to a factor absent from the attribution evidence."
